        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Parafield, South Australia; Adelaide city centre\n- Products: Parafield Airport; Parafield railway station\n- Organizations: University of South Australia\n\nFacts:\n- Parafield Airport is essentially contiguous with the suburb of Parafield, South Australia.\n- Parafield railway station is situated in the northern Adelaide suburb of Parafield and is 17.7 km from Adelaide station.\n- Parafield Airport has the ICAO code YPPF and is on the edge of the residential suburb of Parafield, South Australia, 18 km north of the Adelaide city centre.\n- Parafield Airport is adjacent to the Mawson Lakes campus of the University of South Australia.",
